      "writtenOn": "2026-08-24T23:51:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Several block-level elements generated by markdown are missing from this reset:\n1. `\u003cpre\u003e`: Fenced code blocks (```...```) compile to `\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode\u003e...\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e`. While `code` is set to `display: inline`, `\u003cpre\u003e` retains default user-agent `display: block; white-space: pre;`, disrupting the single-line collapsed view.\n2. `\u003cbr\u003e`: Marked has `breaks: true` enabled in `gr-marked-element.ts`, converting soft linebreaks into `\u003cbr\u003e`. These should be hidden (`display: none;` or replaced with a space) to avoid forcing new lines in collapsed mode.\n3. Tables (`table, thead, tbody, tr, th, td`) and horizontal rules (`hr`).\n4. `blockquote`: `:host([collapsed]) blockquote` resets padding/margin, but `border-left` remains active from the base rule (lines 86-88), drawing an orphan quote bar inline.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "b4dcb1cdb78d3f6adef5d5bac2f256f80f279656",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
