      "message": "Non-`\u003cp\u003e` blocks (such as `h1`–`h6`, `li`, and `blockquote`) do not have trailing space separators. For messages containing headings or lists (e.g. `# Header\\nBody` or `* Item 1\\n* Item 2`), the text from adjacent blocks will concatenate directly without spaces (e.g. `HeaderBody` or `Item 1Item 2`).",
