      "writtenOn": "2026-08-24T23:51:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that `\u003cgr-marked-element\u003e` inside the shadow DOM has `:host { display: block; }` (in `gr-marked-element.ts`). To ensure child inline content remains in a single inline formatting context and doesn\u0027t interfere with parent `text-overflow: ellipsis` (such as in `gr-comment` and `gr-message`), consider setting `:host([collapsed]) gr-marked-element, :host([collapsed]) gr-endpoint-decorator { display: inline; }`.",
